<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-14T00:30:27.221Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan suffered two recent train derailments, one killing four and injuring dozens near Multan and another killing six and wounding forty in central Pakistan. Afghanistan and Pakistan exchanged accusations of cross-border terrorism, with Pakistan blaming Taliban fighters for attacks from Afghan soil and the Taliban accusing Pakistan of baseless claims while reporting a rise in arrests of residents and students after a Panjshir blast. The Taliban announced that 681 Afghan migrants have returned home via four border crossings. The EU launched a €5 million border security project in Pakistan while promoting labour mobility. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPR2QxY0N6ajJtbzNhT0xVWUFHMnVZT2FwX0lLdDUzQ3ozTWpDUHVjdkFDQXlHbTVZYTI3eHp1M2o0NE4tNURsSEVkVUNjYVBrWFlHbmZPcUQyYlV6MFR0d1BZd3J4X0QxWjdIeEJFdm51WmdPU3dFWDNjdzBLSkdhblJ6NEs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Recorder&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOMFdKdTg2eFJtSDV5STFWemdnbF8zcVg5TUw1R2dpSERndUJWNWdEdmMyWi0wQUFLWkRQNHdSMHplMGF0aTkxQVdQZDltblZpRG1RWkNuQV95bVZseWhmV2l3c3JlbHpmYVFOam5mZmpHZDh1b2YzWHNhZUFuTkE5REdPUmVKeWRRNEVRaTZCQXV3LVh0d3lIWVhYNmRCQXRUdDNZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Brussels Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ind